        "title": "Kalvari ching khou poubaumei ta",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kalvari ching khou poubaumei ta,",
            "Kross rukhou sao pirun le",
            "Meinun %&6 jaona nui khang;",
            "Kross rukhou tei thang lou the.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He adi su cho?",
            "Pou %&6 khanglou kanmei tei;",
            "Kapi kaphai kaban jaolo,",
            "Kandihmei pap jang khou %&6,",
            "Nthanmei jei luang kei e,",
            "Njang liangmei pu khou.",
            "",
            "2. Thei khang tari bam puigan khoutei,",
            "Mei khat ‘ni tini mak ge;",
            "Jaojimei nun %&6 raina,",
            "Tari lian laknga thei the.",
            "",
            "3. Tari e na theipui gan khou tei,",
            "Khiangmei dui tijang lou e;",
            "Khiangmei dui %&6 kim lak khe,",
            "Bumang khang tari mei.",
            "",
            "4. Bumang ta kanloumei pu jei tei,",
            "Ai %&6 din lou ngam thui lak ge;",
            "Tatna kalvari ching khou,",
            "Poubaumei ta guang jaolo."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
